A||||6||stsmithgt||Stay  in bed today story.||||9||
Z||000000||stsmithgt||10-25-2000||12:47 PM||||(long)<BR>Wow, What a morning.  I wake up to a dead battery in my car(why?).  My neighbor has me boxed in to where I couldn't push it down to my place to hook up the battery charger.  I tried to push it up hill to get around her car.  OUch! the back spasms start in.  So I climb into the attick and drag out my big cords from when I used to do construction.  Ouch, here comes the neck pain.  Luckily? they reach..  I took off for work and got there an hour late.  When I open the door of my car I hear, SHHHHHHHHHHHHH!!!!  I Picked up a big piece of glass apparently just down the street from work because my tire was flat within a minute. <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif"> The tire place doesn't think they can fix it.  I have to call them later.  I didn't like these tires(Signet), but I wasn't ready to buy others.  It's not the rainy season here yet.  Oh well, I should have stayed in bed.  I haven't clocked in yet and I might not if I have to get tires.  This story ought to make everyone elses day seem much better.  Have a nice day. <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">||||reg||9
Z||000001||Tigger||10-25-2000||01:34 PM||||Ouch, was this with your Fiero?  Pushing a Fiero is not as bad as most cars, but with one person on an incline they can be tough, experience talking here  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif">||||reg||1
Z||000002||stsmithgt||10-25-2000||02:11 PM||||Yeah, I wasn't up to pushing it this morning.  My back wasn't up to it.<BR>     I got my flat tire back... inflated. <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><BR>My battery didn't hold it's charge though.  It's tree or four years old and I've killed it completely a couple of times leaving the parking lights on.  That's why I put a blue dingy thingy in I picked up the last time at the wrecking yard.  Time to go pick up a battery.  This one is a paper weight now.||||reg||1
Z||000003||fieroshop||10-25-2000||02:12 PM||||Hey Todd, now is the time to look at different wheels and get your upgrade and be setup for the brake upgrade.LMAOROTFL<P>------------------<BR> <BR>    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/fieroshop_sig_1.gif"> ||||reg||1
Z||000004||stsmithgt||10-25-2000||04:11 PM||||Ooops.......NOW it's raining! <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/rolleyes.gif"><BR>Hmmmmmm Upgrade...<BR>Right now I have to go get a better battery.(As I ring the water out of my shirt.)  I'll be thinking about an upgrade though. Ideas?  These tires will last me untill I make a decision.(I hope).||||reg||3
Z||000005||stsmithgt||10-25-2000||05:05 PM||||Yeah! New nascar battery with a pro-rating off the old one made it $31.00 cheap instead of $71.00.  That works for me, and now I'm going to go home instead of working today.  I have to go play in the rain a little bit anyway.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">||||reg||14
